%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dolphin
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 2
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Echo Sight
    AbilityDescription: Hold the right trigger and every prism standing inside the next
      crystal blast's destruction volume lights up. Charge sets how THICK that blast is
      - the capsule's diameter across the beam, authored on
      VesselExplosionByCrystalEffectSO as 0.75x the authored core at the resting level
      rising to 1.5x at level 10. It is the one element whose slot both AIMS the weapon
      and SHAPES it, which is why the sight and the thickness share it: the profile you
      are widening is the profile the sight draws. Note the total extent across the gape
      is set by banked energy, so Charge does not make the blast bigger - it redistributes
      that extent, trading a long thin beam for a fat round one. At level 5 the sight
      also lights up VESSELS caught in the same volume, each in its own domain's colour.
    Input: 1
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Pilot Echo
    UpgradeDescription: The sight shows pilots too - any vessel inside the blast lights
      up in its own domain colour.
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Crystal Seeding
    AbilityDescription: PASSIVE - no input. A cooldown runs continuously and each time it
      completes the Dolphin seeds one crystal at a random point in the cell's CYTOPLASM
      (the shell between nucleus and membrane), then restarts immediately. Mass shortens
      that recharge (authored on DeployTeamCrystalActionSO.cooldownMultiplierAtFullMass,
      x0.5 at level 10; the generic map multiplier stays 1.0 so the recharge is driven by
      exactly one number). Below level 5 the seed is an ordinary OMNI crystal wearing the
      lime free-for-all CTA - your own ammunition, standing in open space, for any pilot
      who reaches it first. At level 5 the seed lands TEAM-locked and only your domain can
      collect it.
    Input: 0
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Claimed Seed
    UpgradeDescription: Seeded crystals land team-locked - only your domain can collect
      them.
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Echo Obliteration
    AbilityDescription: The crystal-impact cone itself - released by flying into a crystal,
      so it takes no input of its own. Space carries it further down-range (authored on
      VesselExplosionByCrystalEffectSO._heightMultiplierAtFullSpace, x2 at level 10). The
      three elements own three orthogonal dimensions of one blast - skim energy sets its
      GAPE, Charge sets its THICKNESS, Space sets its REACH - so none of them can steal
      what another one bought. At level 5 the blast stops eating the pilot's own domain.
    Input: 0
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Clean Blast
    UpgradeDescription: The cone spares your own domain - no more friendly fire.
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Charge Fill Rate
    AbilityDescription: Time raises the rate the boost meter charges while drifting
      (authored on ChargeBoostActionSO.chargeRateMultiplierAtFullTime, x1.5 at level 10;
      the generic map multiplier stays 1.0 because VesselTransformer consumes it for boost
      SPEED); at level 5 danger prisms pay triple skim energy.
    Input: 2
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Live Current
    UpgradeDescription: Skimming a danger prism grants 3x energy.
